request.description:
Phase C — multipart: event_id + image file (any test image works for the contract). Idempotent: re-submitting the same event_id does NOT double-award points.

Response 200: { status, already_classified, material_class, confidence, points_awarded, new_balance }
Points table (config/recycling.php): plastic=10, paper=5, metal=15, glass=8, other=0.

Phase D — the spend half of the loop. Admin or teacher.

Response 200: { status, student_id, reward, new_balance, ledger_id }
Response 422: insufficient points, includes current_balance + shortfall.

Phase E — DeepSeek tool-calling; the LLM only SELECTS functions, the backend computes the real answer.

Response 200: { status, answer, functions_called }
Response 503: { status: 'blocked', blocked_reason } when no DEEPSEEK_API_KEY is configured (honest blocker, not a fake answer).

TASK-049 (ADR-068) — revoke a lost/stolen credential (admin-only, school-scoped). Sets status revoked (history kept) and destroys a phone credential's per-credential key in the same transaction; taps answer 404 inactive from the next request, and the id cannot be re-keyed until it is unpaired.

Response 200: { status, revoked: { card_id, credential_uid, kind, key_destroyed }, message }
Response 403: not an admin. Response 404: unknown card or another school's card.
